Package: shellumi
Version: 0.0.2~alpha
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libssl3, openssh-client
Maintainer: Shellumi Contributors <contributors@shellumi.org>
Description: Free, open-source, local-first SSH client and remote infrastructure manager
 Shellumi provides a GPU-accelerated desktop interface built with GPUI in Rust,
 supporting multi-tab and split-pane SSH, Mosh, Telnet, Serial, and SFTP sessions,
 with local metadata persistence and encrypted backups.
